# Bug reports: always confirm the environment

When the user gives a bug report and it is not clear whether it came from **local** or **prod**, ask which environment before investigating or fixing. Do not assume.

This also applies to logs, error traces, and screenshots: if the source environment is ambiguous, ask first.
